WEBVTT

00:09.175 --> 00:10.301
And you are?

00:12.595 --> 00:14.264
I've never seen you before.

00:16.808 --> 00:19.019
You've got a lot of guts.

00:26.067 --> 00:28.445
Hey, move it. Go. Move it, move it.

00:28.528 --> 00:29.821
Move it, you punks.

00:31.281 --> 00:32.782
Hey, Gotak, you still alive?

00:33.950 --> 00:35.493
Hyo-man, are you okay?

00:35.577 --> 00:37.537
- Yes. Go.
- Go where?

00:39.039 --> 00:41.124
- Just go, you assholes.
- What are you doing?

00:41.207 --> 00:43.543
- I fainted. Go.
- You need to be practicing with the team.

00:43.626 --> 00:44.627
Not here.

00:45.128 --> 00:47.464
What? Practice?

00:47.547 --> 00:51.051
Hey. We can't even compete
in the tournament because of you.

00:51.801 --> 00:53.261
What are you talking about, dickhead?

00:53.344 --> 00:54.971
We can't compete in the tournament,

00:55.055 --> 00:57.599
because you were suspended,
you stupid idiot.

00:58.224 --> 01:01.811
- Fuck.
- Man, really? Are you sure?

01:03.021 --> 01:06.274
Oh. Oh! I shouldn't have dyed my hair.

01:06.858 --> 01:09.319
- This color takes a while to fade. Hey!
- You fucking asshole!

01:10.653 --> 01:12.447
Hey, you happy to see me?

01:12.530 --> 01:13.531
Huh? What about you?

01:13.615 --> 01:14.908
- My arm. My arm. My arm.
- Yeah?

01:17.535 --> 01:18.661
Fuck, please!

01:22.999 --> 01:25.585
Man.

01:25.668 --> 01:28.671
I don't care what you guys do
to be full of yourselves or whatever,

01:28.755 --> 01:31.925
but when you're wearing Eunjang's uniform,
no fighting allowed.

01:32.008 --> 01:34.803
Repeat after me.
Let's hear it. No fighting allowed!

01:34.886 --> 01:36.262
No fighting allowed.

01:36.346 --> 01:38.973
That's it. Now get outta here.
Yeah! Go. Go. Go.

01:39.057 --> 01:40.517
- Uh…
- Go.

01:41.017 --> 01:42.227
Yes. Let's go.

01:42.310 --> 01:43.978
Go, go, go.

01:45.772 --> 01:47.524
Si-eun-a, this is yours.

01:48.108 --> 01:49.150
Are you okay?

01:50.485 --> 01:51.444
Thanks.

01:53.363 --> 01:54.739
Hey, Si-eun.

01:58.326 --> 01:59.327
Sorry.

02:00.453 --> 02:02.914
I think I had the wrong impression.

02:05.416 --> 02:06.543
Hey.

02:06.626 --> 02:10.380
I don't know what's goin' on, but saying,
"I think," doesn't show sincerity.

02:10.463 --> 02:13.216
I'm sorry!
My dear Gotak comes with lots of faults.

02:13.299 --> 02:16.970
- Man, stop it! Please? Just go.
- But he… he isn't a bad kid at heart!

02:18.179 --> 02:19.222
Aah!

02:20.348 --> 02:22.183
Si-eun-a, where are you going?

02:24.144 --> 02:26.479
Oh, I'll see you tomorrow. Bye.

02:28.022 --> 02:30.608
- Si-eun-a, you can't just leave like that!
- Oh-ho!

02:31.109 --> 02:33.403
That kind of politeness is
rarely found in Eunjang.

02:33.987 --> 02:35.363
Such a dumbass.

02:35.446 --> 02:37.157
Who were you trying
to impersonate this time?

02:37.240 --> 02:38.533
No idea. My dad?

02:41.286 --> 02:43.288
Anyway, the timing was insane.

02:45.165 --> 02:46.124
What if

02:46.624 --> 02:48.376
Park Hu-min hadn't shown up?

02:51.880 --> 02:55.216
You ruined someone else's life,
so stop acting all high and mighty.

02:57.218 --> 02:58.928
What a fucking hypocrite.

03:06.561 --> 03:07.937
You must've been

03:09.272 --> 03:12.567
offended by all the stuff
Hyun-tak said back there.

03:13.651 --> 03:15.403
Don't worry about the rumor.

03:15.486 --> 03:16.988
It's just, they all pretty much like

03:17.071 --> 03:19.365
to talk about other people
behind their backs.

03:21.409 --> 03:22.827
It's not a rumor.

03:23.912 --> 03:24.871
Huh?

03:30.043 --> 03:32.754
That's why I never wanted
to fight with the other kids.

03:38.760 --> 03:39.802
Ever again.

04:02.450 --> 04:07.622
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

05:02.593 --> 05:05.430
11TH GRADE, CLASS 7
09 - PARK HU-MIN

05:09.517 --> 05:10.768
- Hey. Hey!
- Baku!

05:10.852 --> 05:12.687
- Oh, hey there! Hey, there!
- Baku!

05:12.770 --> 05:15.648
Oh yeah! It's nice to be back!
Hey, good to see you.

05:15.732 --> 05:17.984
Hey, you put that cigarette out!
You little shit.

05:18.067 --> 05:19.277
- Hey, Baku.
- Hey there.

05:19.360 --> 05:20.236
Ah-ha-ha!

05:20.320 --> 05:21.988
- How are you, man?
- How've you been?

05:22.071 --> 05:23.948
Yeah, I'll see you at the cafeteria later.

05:24.032 --> 05:25.408
Hey! You've lost so much weight!

05:25.491 --> 05:27.660
- Whoa, you been good?
- Doing all right?

05:31.539 --> 05:32.790
Can you stand?

05:36.461 --> 05:37.628
Everybody, freeze!

05:41.007 --> 05:42.050
Baku.

05:43.134 --> 05:45.386
- You need to stop harassing other kids.
- It's Ba… Baku.

05:45.470 --> 05:47.513
- It's Baku.
- It's not the World Cup stadium.

05:48.681 --> 05:50.641
It's better to kick the ball outside.

05:52.518 --> 05:54.020
Oh, outside? Heh.

05:54.103 --> 05:56.022
That's a great idea. Right, guys?

05:56.105 --> 05:57.857
We should've thought of that. Right?

05:58.941 --> 06:01.235
Everybody, try to get along!

06:01.319 --> 06:03.988
Huh? Hey, man. That's right.
Hey, back to your classes.

06:04.072 --> 06:06.949
Get your butts back to class.
Don't be late. See ya later!

06:07.033 --> 06:08.326
- Aah!
- Whoa!

06:08.409 --> 06:09.911
- Oh my God!
- Nice to see you!

06:09.994 --> 06:12.663
Oh, Baku, Baku! Hell, yeah!

06:17.794 --> 06:20.463
You son of a bitch. Listen, Baku-ya.

06:21.214 --> 06:23.466
Those asshats at Ganghak High
don't play basketball.

06:23.549 --> 06:25.718
It's practically mixed martial arts.

06:25.802 --> 06:28.721
Why do we have to play a practice game
when they don't even know basketball?

06:28.805 --> 06:32.934
There are all different kinds
of teams out there, Gotak.

06:33.017 --> 06:36.813
A true master
doesn't care who he plays against.

06:36.896 --> 06:38.898
If there are different kinds
of teams out there,

06:38.981 --> 06:41.234
that means we can play a different team.

06:41.317 --> 06:43.236
You don't want anybody
getting hurt out there.

06:43.319 --> 06:44.737
- Do you?
- You're a chicken.

06:48.032 --> 06:49.367
Dumbass.

06:49.450 --> 06:52.203
You scored 99 on the IQ test
in middle school. Are you a monkey?

06:53.287 --> 06:55.123
- Dolphins are smarter.
- I will kill you.

06:55.206 --> 06:58.126
I just couldn't finish the test in time,
you dickhead.

06:58.209 --> 06:59.877
He couldn't finish it.

06:59.961 --> 07:02.338
Not enough time?
It wasn't enough time for you?

07:02.422 --> 07:06.259
- Running out of time makes you an idiot.
- Hey! Okay, then, Professor Gotak.

07:06.342 --> 07:07.885
You think you're all grown-up?

07:07.969 --> 07:10.179
I've always been taller than you.
How's that for grown-up?

07:10.263 --> 07:11.431
- You're a dead man!
- Come on!

07:11.514 --> 07:13.558
- Hey, okay!
- You'll kill him.

07:13.641 --> 07:14.559
I give in!

07:18.229 --> 07:19.063
What?

07:20.857 --> 07:21.941
Is this a raid?

07:25.736 --> 07:27.572
The teacher wants to see us.

07:27.655 --> 07:31.325
Well, that did actually happen
in the underpass,

07:32.160 --> 07:34.829
but it's been blown
a little out of proportion…

07:34.912 --> 07:38.374
Everyone who hangs out with
Choi Hyo-man is absent from school.

07:38.458 --> 07:40.668
Doesn't that seem weird to all of you?

07:41.294 --> 07:43.880
And more than a couple of kids
saw you all fighting.

07:45.089 --> 07:46.424
False acquisition.

07:50.386 --> 07:53.222
Hey, dumbass.
It's "accusation," not "acquisition."

07:53.306 --> 07:55.016
Hey, dumbass. I said "accusation."

07:55.099 --> 07:56.476
- 99 IQ idiot.
- Shh.

07:56.559 --> 07:58.644
- Is your brain completely empty?
- Shut up, dumbass.

07:58.728 --> 08:00.354
- Hey. Be quiet.
- Idiot.

08:00.980 --> 08:03.399
Take these. Here.

08:03.483 --> 08:04.734
YOUTH CULTURAL VOLUNTEERS WANTED

08:04.817 --> 08:08.196
Make it up volunteering over
the weekend. You'll still get demerits.

08:08.279 --> 08:10.781
Wait, what about Hyo-man
and all those guys, then?

08:11.491 --> 08:15.328
It's unfair to single us out. Especially
since they were the ones who started it.

08:15.411 --> 08:19.207
Hey! Does it sound like
I'm here to debate this with you?

08:21.918 --> 08:22.960
You brats.

08:23.628 --> 08:24.795
But it's true.

08:27.757 --> 08:30.301
Hyo-man and those guys
started the fight with us.

08:30.384 --> 08:31.928
- We just--
- Yeon Si-eun.

08:32.512 --> 08:34.055
Did they rub off on you already?

08:35.097 --> 08:38.351
- All you brats always talking back.
- I'm sorry, sir!

08:38.851 --> 08:40.436
We'll volunteer diligently from now on.

08:40.520 --> 08:44.065
I'll make sure the basketball club doesn't
get involved in things like this anymore.

08:44.148 --> 08:48.152
Once again, sir, as the captain of the
basketball club, I sincerely apologize!

08:52.615 --> 08:55.743
Come on, volunteering?

08:55.826 --> 08:58.287
- Aah!
- Aren't you pissed off at all?

08:58.371 --> 09:00.289
You gonna let Hyo-man
and those guys off the hook?

09:00.373 --> 09:04.460
Man, I get dizzy when I breathe the air
in the teachers' office. I almost puked.

09:04.544 --> 09:07.505
And you did get into a fight.
What did I tell you about not fighting?

09:07.588 --> 09:10.508
I wasn't looking for it.
They started it with us, Baku-ya.

09:11.008 --> 09:12.093
Hey, friend.

09:16.430 --> 09:17.765
He wants to say something.

09:18.474 --> 09:20.810
- I do?
- You have something to say, man.

09:20.893 --> 09:23.646
He sided with you
back in the teachers' office too, kid.

09:28.568 --> 09:29.527
Well…

09:30.820 --> 09:31.904
I'm sorry

09:32.738 --> 09:33.906
'bout yesterday.

09:35.491 --> 09:38.619
For saying that stuff
and getting mad at you.

09:38.703 --> 09:39.704
So am I.

09:40.997 --> 09:41.998
What?

09:42.915 --> 09:45.459
I'm sorry for yesterday.

09:48.546 --> 09:49.505
What?

09:50.172 --> 09:53.134
Sounds like you two made up,
but not really…

09:53.217 --> 09:54.093
Hey.

09:55.094 --> 09:56.262
I'm not in the club.

09:59.307 --> 10:01.851
And also, don't touch my head anymore.

10:10.067 --> 10:12.236
What are you gonna do? Huh?

10:13.154 --> 10:15.197
What are you gonna do about it? Huh?

10:15.281 --> 10:17.658
What you gonna do?
What you gonna do about it?

10:17.742 --> 10:19.744
What are you doing?

10:20.661 --> 10:23.247
Hey, buddy.
Things in life happen sometimes, hmm?

10:23.748 --> 10:25.708
Your turn.
Like this. You can do it to me too.

10:25.791 --> 10:26.751
Yeah. Like this.

10:26.834 --> 10:28.377
Hey, hey, hey, Baku.

10:28.461 --> 10:31.631
Why are you so hyper today?
Enough's enough, all right?

10:31.714 --> 10:33.466
All right, try getting suspended.

10:33.549 --> 10:35.051
It's freaking boring.

10:35.134 --> 10:38.054
I almost burst into tears
because I missed the pizza bread here.

10:38.763 --> 10:41.015
So why'd
you get yourself suspended, then?

10:41.557 --> 10:46.270
Hey, my friends! Come with us!
Today, your grub is on Gotak!

10:46.354 --> 10:48.189
- Hey, mark him, mark him.
- Aah!

10:48.272 --> 10:49.482
Okay.

10:49.565 --> 10:51.692
He seems kinda odd, right?

10:51.776 --> 10:54.737
But things
have been peaceful here.

10:55.363 --> 10:58.366
It's because Baku protects all of us.

10:58.449 --> 11:00.034
Let's go for one more.

11:00.117 --> 11:01.285
The thing is,

11:02.370 --> 11:04.205
there's a group called the Union.

11:04.288 --> 11:08.042
It's a collective that all school gangs
in the area are a part of.

11:09.543 --> 11:10.961
Rumor has it that

11:12.421 --> 11:14.757
Na Baek-jin of Yeoil High,

11:14.840 --> 11:17.009
Geum Seong-je of Ganghak High,

11:17.885 --> 11:20.137
Do Seong-mok of Yeonsung High,

11:20.221 --> 11:21.514
Baek Dong-ha,

11:22.890 --> 11:24.975
and many others get together

11:25.559 --> 11:27.978
to conduct business like a real gang.

11:29.563 --> 11:33.401
Hyo-man had been collecting phones
so he could get into the Union.

11:35.653 --> 11:38.364
But Hu-min said
he wasn't into things like that,

11:38.447 --> 11:41.325
so Eunjang was the only school
that wasn't in the Union.

11:41.409 --> 11:42.576
EUNJANG HIGH, NO FIGHTING
BAKU

11:42.660 --> 11:44.870
After that,
kids in the Union would take money

11:44.954 --> 11:48.124
and pick fights with anyone
they saw in an Eunjang uniform.

11:48.207 --> 11:49.709
It was total chaos.

11:50.418 --> 11:54.255
Park Hu-min got pissed off
and beat up everyone in the Union.

11:56.632 --> 11:59.677
Apparently, no one in the Union
stood a chance against him.

12:03.139 --> 12:05.182
Baku did that to protect us.

12:06.851 --> 12:08.144
As Eunjang's top dog.

12:10.730 --> 12:12.064
- Yeah!
- Nice!

12:12.148 --> 12:14.692
- The bottom line is he fought.
- One, two, three! Yeah!

12:14.775 --> 12:16.819
- Nice.
- Let's go, let's go.

12:16.902 --> 12:18.571
Hey, Si-eun, Jun-tae!

12:19.071 --> 12:21.073
Play with us! Come on!

12:21.157 --> 12:23.325
Hey, dumbass. Stop harassing them.

12:26.704 --> 12:31.208
I don't want to nag, but then
you shouldn't have done anything violent.

12:32.376 --> 12:34.754
You concerned the school
and made them call me.

12:40.259 --> 12:42.636
It's not saying
I don't trust you, Si-eun-a.

12:43.971 --> 12:45.389
I'm just getting worried.

12:47.475 --> 12:48.559
Something…

12:50.144 --> 12:52.188
something like that can't happen again.

12:55.024 --> 12:59.403
You… you haven't been hanging out
with sketchy kids again, have you?

13:16.712 --> 13:18.672
- Good work.
- Thank you!

13:18.756 --> 13:20.674
- I told you to meet the quota.
- Thank you.

13:20.758 --> 13:21.926
Thank you.

13:22.009 --> 13:23.886
- How am I to face Baek-jin?
- Thank you.

13:23.969 --> 13:25.095
Thank you.

13:25.179 --> 13:29.183
If you haven't found anything,
you need to steal to meet the quota!

13:29.266 --> 13:30.476
- Got that?
- We're sorry!

13:32.895 --> 13:34.355
Hey, you fucking asshole.

13:37.858 --> 13:39.860
Hey, move it. Move it.

13:43.614 --> 13:45.741
These shitheads from Eunjang High.

13:46.742 --> 13:49.703
We should round them up
and just kill them all.

13:55.668 --> 13:57.586
Well, Baek-jin wants to see your face.

13:58.838 --> 14:00.548
Let's go.

14:01.841 --> 14:02.716
GEUM SEONG-JE

14:02.800 --> 14:05.177
Hey, what was
that shit's name again?

14:06.303 --> 14:07.429
Choi Hyo-man, right?

14:08.973 --> 14:10.391
Anyway, that dumbass.

14:10.474 --> 14:13.727
He hasn't brought enough money,
and he lost all the phones he collected.

14:16.021 --> 14:17.815
I heard he got owned by Baku.

14:19.733 --> 14:22.403
I shouldn't have trusted him
to begin with. 

14:22.486 --> 14:25.072
We won't secure Eunjang
as long as Baku's around.

14:26.740 --> 14:27.616
Baek-jin-a.

14:29.869 --> 14:32.371
I'll do whatever it takes
to handle this on my end.

14:32.872 --> 14:36.417
- If you give me a little more time--
- I said keep your mouth closed, dickhead.

14:36.500 --> 14:37.960
You're out of the Union.

14:38.711 --> 14:41.130
What would you do with more time? Huh?

14:43.674 --> 14:46.594
Baek-jin-a, what should we do?

14:55.060 --> 14:56.228
Baek-jin-a, please.

14:56.312 --> 14:58.731
Please stop. Baek-jin-a, one second.

14:58.814 --> 15:01.442
- Get out of here. Hurry up.
- Please? Baek-jin-a!

15:02.151 --> 15:03.819
- Baek-jin-a!
- Just go!

15:11.702 --> 15:12.745
Seong-je-ya,

15:14.371 --> 15:16.248
let's go check in on Park Hu-min.

15:17.875 --> 15:19.376
Baku?

15:20.753 --> 15:21.629
Sounds great.

15:22.588 --> 15:24.673
I've been itching for some action lately.

15:25.382 --> 15:26.383
Okay.

15:28.385 --> 15:31.138
SEOUL MUSEUM OF HISTORY

15:32.348 --> 15:34.975
- Okay, Ji-u. Face the front. Look!
- Smile, Ji-u-ya.

15:35.059 --> 15:37.978
- Show your teeth. Big smile.
- One, two, three. Peace sign?

15:38.062 --> 15:39.188
- Now.
- That's my girl.

15:39.271 --> 15:42.691
Dad, this king is making
a weird face. I don't like it.

15:43.317 --> 15:46.195
Please, will you goddesses
give me just one more chance?

15:46.904 --> 15:50.658
I heard there's a precious treasure
that was hidden somewhere here.

15:51.241 --> 15:52.451
I looked all over.

15:52.952 --> 15:54.536
And I found it!

15:54.620 --> 15:55.788
Who's that?

15:55.871 --> 15:57.957
- Who was that guy?
- No idea.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.417
Why do you keep
fluttering into my heart?

16:01.293 --> 16:02.795
- Butterflies of love.
- Ah!

16:03.629 --> 16:04.838
- Eat slow.
- What?

16:04.922 --> 16:07.758
Slow down, bro. You barely worked,
and you're shoveling your food.

16:08.425 --> 16:11.345
Hey! Hey, focus, focus.

16:11.929 --> 16:12.930
Guys.

16:13.597 --> 16:16.100
I got the numbers of girls
from Buil Girls' High.

16:17.226 --> 16:18.894
Should I ask them out to dinner or what?

16:19.395 --> 16:22.106
Lost cause.
A hundred percent, they'd turn you down.

16:22.189 --> 16:23.857
Then how about this? Hmm?

16:23.941 --> 16:26.193
If I manage to set up
dinner plans with them,

16:26.276 --> 16:28.737
then you're paying, deal?

16:30.614 --> 16:31.740
- Deal.
- It's a deal.

16:31.824 --> 16:33.826
- If you're turned down, dinner's on you.
- Okay, fine.

16:33.909 --> 16:35.035
- Deal.
- What do you wanna eat?

16:35.119 --> 16:37.705
- Think of something delicious.
- I'll eat something really expensive.

16:37.788 --> 16:39.206
- Okay, sure.
- You're dead.

16:40.749 --> 16:43.002
The number you have dialed
is not in service.

16:43.836 --> 16:45.796
Please check the number and dial again.

16:46.547 --> 16:49.383
Hah! Aren't cell phone numbers
usually eight digits

16:49.466 --> 16:51.760
without the zero-one-zero in the front?

16:51.844 --> 16:53.012
One, two, three…

16:53.512 --> 16:54.763
Oh my God!

16:54.847 --> 16:57.266
- It's nine digits!
- Give it back, asshole.

16:57.349 --> 17:00.185
- "Give it back!" Why are you mad?
- Oh, that's why!

17:00.269 --> 17:01.854
She made a small mistake here.

17:01.937 --> 17:04.565
- It's not two sevens, it's actually one.
- Mm-hmm.

17:04.648 --> 17:06.483
- Now she'll pick up.
- Try it.

17:06.567 --> 17:08.736
- You're dead. You're so dead!
- Go ahead.

17:08.819 --> 17:10.612
- I wondered!
- Call again. Do it!

17:10.696 --> 17:12.448
Ah, shit!

17:12.531 --> 17:14.450
Wait, give me your phone. Hey, dummy.

17:14.533 --> 17:17.786
You have to put it on speaker.

17:17.870 --> 17:19.621
Hello, you've reached
Seonheung Finance.

17:19.705 --> 17:22.207
- Hwang Min-sik speaking.
- Sorry, I dialed the wrong number.

17:23.834 --> 17:25.669
- What?
- I swear, I'll take your mouth…

17:25.753 --> 17:27.921
- I'm gonna--
- Hey, hey. I'm sorry. I'm truly…

17:34.887 --> 17:37.264
Oh, it's hard
to get Buldak sauce out.

17:37.848 --> 17:39.099
Hey, Jun-tae-ya.

17:39.183 --> 17:41.268
Get rid of the chopsticks
in front of Si-eun.

17:41.351 --> 17:43.604
I hear he stabs people
with chopsticks and stuff.

17:43.687 --> 17:46.148
Si-eun, put those away.
It was a mistake.

17:46.231 --> 17:47.566
I didn't do anything wrong.

17:47.649 --> 17:49.443
I'm going to the restroom.

18:19.473 --> 18:20.724
Are you Baku's friend?

18:31.902 --> 18:32.903
Hey, you know,

18:33.737 --> 18:36.740
people say you'll ruin your life
hanging with the wrong crowd.

18:43.163 --> 18:44.331
Oh, here it is.

18:45.207 --> 18:46.834
Now, look over here.

18:48.418 --> 18:50.337
One, two, three.

18:53.799 --> 18:55.968
You have sad eyes. Yeah?

18:59.972 --> 19:01.473
Do you know me?

19:14.736 --> 19:16.530
Man, look at this guy.

19:21.451 --> 19:22.619
Lower your eyes.

19:31.461 --> 19:32.629
Whew.

19:44.224 --> 19:45.726
Not bad.

19:52.274 --> 19:55.944
What? You plan to crack my skull?

19:58.030 --> 20:00.365
I just came by to say hi,
so let's end it here.

20:01.658 --> 20:03.035
Until we meet again.

20:07.122 --> 20:09.249
I'll pummel you the next time we meet.

20:20.010 --> 20:22.054
- No way.
- You made my stomach hurt.

20:22.137 --> 20:24.890
- They weren't into you. It was me.
- The toilet calls. Go!

20:24.973 --> 20:27.226
- It was honestly… Whoa, what?
- Oh shit, man.

20:27.309 --> 20:30.729
- How many dumps do you take a day?
- I'm dying. Oh!

20:36.360 --> 20:37.361
What?

20:41.907 --> 20:43.075
Hey, Baku.

20:44.826 --> 20:46.912
What are you? A fucking woodcutter?

20:47.996 --> 20:49.122
Why are you here?

20:50.499 --> 20:52.000
What do you think?

20:52.584 --> 20:54.169
I came to see how you're doing.

20:56.630 --> 20:58.966
And then I bumped into an unfamiliar face.

21:00.425 --> 21:02.678
- So I said hi.
- What?

21:13.021 --> 21:14.189
I'll kick your ass.

21:21.154 --> 21:22.739
Okay, keep snickering, man.

21:23.991 --> 21:25.450
It'll be your funeral.

21:29.371 --> 21:31.790
You still not planning
to joining the Union?

21:31.873 --> 21:34.751
Every fucking school is in it
except for Eunjang.

21:34.835 --> 21:36.086
Fuck this.

21:36.837 --> 21:38.964
- Aren't you sick of this?
- I am.

21:40.841 --> 21:42.134
I am sick of this.

21:44.594 --> 21:46.263
But I guess Baek-jin isn't.

21:51.852 --> 21:52.978
I get it, though.

21:56.356 --> 21:59.693
Try to get along with Baek-jin.
Put an end to your lovers' quarrel.

22:06.908 --> 22:07.868
Shit.

22:12.998 --> 22:14.082
Hey, are you okay?

22:14.624 --> 22:16.168
Did you meet a weird guy?

22:18.462 --> 22:20.380
I'm sorry Si-eun. It's because of me.

22:23.091 --> 22:24.217
What is?

22:25.510 --> 22:26.470
Huh?

22:29.181 --> 22:30.599
What's because of you?

22:33.935 --> 22:35.937
Nothing. Never mind.

22:39.066 --> 22:42.152
We'll now present
the Outstanding Student Award.

22:42.235 --> 22:43.779
The above student excelled

22:43.862 --> 22:47.199
on the National High School Association
Academic Evaluation

22:47.282 --> 22:50.577
for the second semester
of the 2023 academic year…

22:50.660 --> 22:53.038
What? Why is he getting an award?

22:53.121 --> 22:55.582
- What was his score?
- Forget his score.

22:56.083 --> 22:58.627
He only got the trick question wrong,
number 30 in mathematics.

22:58.710 --> 23:01.671
- …enhancing the honor…
- Whoa, that's insane.

23:01.755 --> 23:03.423
We present this award
to Na Baek-jin

23:03.507 --> 23:06.134
in year 2, class 2 of Yeoil High School.

23:36.998 --> 23:38.917
DONGMYEONG BANK
DEPOSITED: 12,435,000 WON

23:39.000 --> 23:40.669
DEPOSITED: 7,435,000 WON

23:44.131 --> 23:47.008
Baek-jin-a, we took care
of all the phones we collected.

23:47.968 --> 23:50.387
Remember how Eunjang was
the only school left out?

23:50.470 --> 23:53.056
Well, I guess that loser
assembled everyone somehow.

23:53.890 --> 23:56.435
He called and said he wanted
to meet you in person.

24:01.731 --> 24:03.733
It's a pain,
but you should meet with him.

24:03.817 --> 24:05.152
I'll send you the address.

24:41.730 --> 24:43.857
- Wait, what? Where'd he go?
- What?

24:43.940 --> 24:44.858
Look for him.

24:44.941 --> 24:47.736
- It's too fucking dark to see.
- Damn it. It's locked.

24:47.819 --> 24:50.530
Is he not there?
Where is that son of a bitch?

24:50.614 --> 24:52.616
Hey. Are you sure
he came in this way?

24:52.699 --> 24:54.951
- What the fuck is going on?
- Come out!

24:55.035 --> 24:56.286
- Not there?
- No.

24:56.369 --> 24:58.788
- Where did he go?
- I can't believe this.

24:59.998 --> 25:01.374
- Ugh.
- What's going on?

25:01.458 --> 25:03.210
I know he came in this way.

25:03.293 --> 25:04.336
Hey, hey.

25:24.689 --> 25:25.649
What?

25:26.650 --> 25:29.069
"What?"

25:30.195 --> 25:31.112
Hey.

25:32.364 --> 25:36.451
Is it your favorite thing to just, like,
fucking use people and throw 'em away?

25:38.036 --> 25:41.790
I did fucking everything you told me to,
you goddamn asshole.

25:44.251 --> 25:45.252
Hey, Baek-jin-a.

25:46.294 --> 25:47.754
I did a little digging.

25:48.588 --> 25:50.757
I heard all you ever fucking do is study.

25:52.133 --> 25:55.470
I bet you can't fight for shit.
You hide behind Geum Seong-je, huh?

25:55.554 --> 25:57.597
You just punch numbers
into a calculator and shit.

25:59.933 --> 26:01.309
Ignoring me?

26:01.893 --> 26:02.852
Ugh!

26:04.104 --> 26:05.605
I had to keep asking myself

26:05.689 --> 26:09.859
how the hell some petty-ass,
trick-playing guy is head of the Union.

26:14.656 --> 26:16.992
One pair of brass knuckles.
Two steel pipes.

26:17.075 --> 26:18.660
Save the loudmouth for last.

26:20.412 --> 26:22.747
What are you
waiting for? Get him!

26:36.094 --> 26:37.220
Oh shit.

26:47.188 --> 26:48.481
Fuck you!

27:08.627 --> 27:10.211
Hey, you son of a bitch!

27:33.401 --> 27:35.278
Come more prepared next time.

27:55.048 --> 27:58.134
SEONG-JE: NEW FACES APPEARED
ONE'S A WUSS AND ONE'S NOT BAD

27:58.218 --> 27:59.469
WHAT SHOULD I DO?

28:14.818 --> 28:18.571
Why am I so low on energy today?
Oh, I'm hungry.

28:18.655 --> 28:21.324
Let's eat something amazing!
Hey, let's eat! It's on me!

28:21.408 --> 28:22.283
- Yeah?
- Yes!

28:22.367 --> 28:24.619
- All right!
- Bullshit. He's not gonna treat us.

28:24.703 --> 28:26.287
- He just said that he would.
- He's lying.

28:26.371 --> 28:27.872
- Don't believe--
- I know a great place.

28:27.956 --> 28:30.041
What's important is good food.
You know Michelin stars?

28:30.125 --> 28:33.712
- Michelin, my ass. Don't let him fool you.
- I'm not bullshitting. It'll be great.

28:33.795 --> 28:35.547
- I have to leave.
- Huh?

28:37.590 --> 28:39.759
Why? You said you'd have dinner with us.

28:41.886 --> 28:43.930
- When did I say that?
- Well… uh…

28:46.474 --> 28:47.809
Ah, I guess you didn't.

28:48.643 --> 28:51.855
You should still come with us, Si-eun-a.
We had a tough day.

28:52.814 --> 28:55.150
- I have someone who's waiting.
- Ah…

28:56.317 --> 28:58.194
You're gonna regret this big time.

28:58.278 --> 29:00.739
I'll let you go since
you said you'd treat us next time.

29:00.822 --> 29:02.574
- Have a good night!
- Be safe!

29:03.742 --> 29:05.744
Anyway, he's not gonna pay.

29:05.827 --> 29:07.120
Hey, what's going on?

29:08.329 --> 29:09.956
I said it's my treat!

29:10.039 --> 29:11.541
BAKU CHICKEN

29:16.629 --> 29:19.340
- It's coming out of your allowance.
- Abeoji, please, come on.

29:19.424 --> 29:20.300
My friends are here.

29:20.383 --> 29:22.427
Then fry the chicken yourself,
spoiled brat.

29:26.306 --> 29:28.099
That freeloader…

29:39.152 --> 29:41.237
It's okay. Come on.
Eat up. Eat up. Eat up.

29:41.321 --> 29:43.698
Eat up. Eat up.
Hey, Jun-tae, take a drumstick.

29:43.782 --> 29:45.200
- Here. Eat up.
- All right, let's eat.

29:49.245 --> 29:51.164
Oh, right. What about Jun-tae?

29:51.748 --> 29:54.125
- Hmm?
- You said something happened at school.

29:54.709 --> 29:58.463
Oh, you know how that guy Hyo-man,
used to steal kids' phones and money?

29:58.546 --> 30:02.509
Well, Jun-tae got everything back
and returned everyone's belongings

30:02.592 --> 30:05.428
by delivering them all
to the kids in the entire school.

30:08.097 --> 30:10.809
Yeah. Isn't that freaking awesome?

30:16.481 --> 30:18.316
Jun-tae, my man.

30:19.984 --> 30:21.528
You've got some guts, don't you?

30:26.157 --> 30:28.743
Whoa, Jun-tae! That's so cool.

30:29.994 --> 30:33.748
Not at all, I just took the advice
Si-eun gave to me.

30:33.832 --> 30:35.291
Wh… what advice was it?

30:36.626 --> 30:37.627
The advice…

30:39.379 --> 30:41.172
Do you know about Newton's third law?

30:41.256 --> 30:43.299
…was about Newton's third law.

30:43.883 --> 30:45.385
"For every positive action,

30:45.468 --> 30:48.012
there's a corresponding reaction
that follows."

30:52.851 --> 30:55.603
Wow. The U-turn law, man? What?

30:57.230 --> 30:59.649
I have no idea what that is,
but it sounds freaking amazing.

30:59.732 --> 31:01.693
I'm gonna use that later.

31:04.487 --> 31:08.116
Hey, I heard Si-eun was
forced to transfer to our school

31:08.199 --> 31:10.076
after getting in some major trouble.

31:10.869 --> 31:12.996
He seems all right to me.
Not that I know him.

31:13.079 --> 31:16.332
Si-eun was the one who saved me
when I was getting beaten up by Hyo-man.

31:17.292 --> 31:18.751
He's really nice.

31:22.630 --> 31:24.507
Ah. I hope Si-eun

31:25.842 --> 31:27.093
got home safely.

31:29.679 --> 31:33.141
PATIENT'S NAME: AHN SU-HO
VISITOR: YEON SI-EUN

31:33.224 --> 31:35.560
RELATIONSHIP TO PATIENT: FRIEND

31:47.322 --> 31:48.364
Hello?

31:48.448 --> 31:51.200
Si-eun? Hey, it's me, Hu-min.

31:54.412 --> 31:55.330
Yeah, what?

31:55.955 --> 31:59.459
What do you mean, "Yeah, what"?
I called to see if you got home all right.

31:59.542 --> 32:02.545
So? No one tailed you?

32:02.629 --> 32:04.464
You made it home all safe and sound?

32:07.967 --> 32:09.636
Yeah, I'm home now.

32:09.719 --> 32:11.429
Really? 

32:12.347 --> 32:13.681
And, um…

32:13.765 --> 32:16.142
You know how I got turned down
by those girls today?

32:16.225 --> 32:17.352
I gave it some thought,

32:17.936 --> 32:19.479
and I realized that you might have

32:19.562 --> 32:22.106
the kind of looks
that girls are into these days.

32:22.190 --> 32:23.816
So while we're on the topic,

32:24.734 --> 32:27.445
we should go pick up some girls together!

32:31.282 --> 32:32.367
Why would I do that?

32:33.368 --> 32:34.577
Okay, shithead.

32:41.626 --> 32:42.502
Huh.

32:48.716 --> 32:50.635
I had to volunteer today.

32:52.512 --> 32:53.763
It wasn't so bad

32:55.014 --> 32:56.307
once I got there.

32:59.852 --> 33:01.354
The weather was nice too.

33:03.064 --> 33:04.232
Above all,

33:05.441 --> 33:08.319
it took my mind off things
for the first time in a while.

33:10.363 --> 33:12.532
I wondered, "How did that happen?"

33:15.702 --> 33:18.037
I think it was thanks
to the guys I was with.

33:47.692 --> 33:49.485
So this jerk is Ahn Su-ho.

33:50.361 --> 33:51.404
Your friend.

33:53.281 --> 33:56.409
The kid whose life you ruined, right?

34:03.708 --> 34:04.751
Why are you here?

34:04.834 --> 34:06.127
What are you gonna do,

34:06.794 --> 34:08.337
now that you're standing up?

34:09.255 --> 34:10.131
Hmm?

34:21.059 --> 34:22.602
Come with me for a second.

34:25.021 --> 34:27.273
You shouldn't interrupt
your friend's sleep.

34:32.695 --> 34:33.821
Huh.

34:34.906 --> 34:38.201
You look like the kind of kid
I love to beat up.

34:38.284 --> 34:39.994
Just my type.

34:41.621 --> 34:43.289
Get moving, you fuckin' asshole.
